# Requisições de exemplo, só com dados sintéticos. Gere um token local com:
#   dotnet user-jwts create --project src/Services/PatientVault/CareFlow.PatientVault.Api \
#     --scope "vault.read vault.write" --claim tenant_id=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 -o token
@host = http://localhost:5124
@token = cole-o-token-aqui
@patientRef = cole-o-patientRef-aqui
@etag = "cole-o-etag-aqui"

### Cadastrar paciente (devolve só o patientRef e o ETag)
POST {{host}}/v1/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Paciente Sintético da Silva",
  "cpf": "123.456.789-09",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-20",
  "email": "paciente.sintetico@example.com",
  "phone": "+55 11 90000-0000"
}

### Ler dados pessoais (exige vault.read)
GET {{host}}/v1/patients/{{patientRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alterar contatos (exige If-Match com o ETag lido)
PUT {{host}}/v1/patients/{{patientRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: {{etag}}

{
  "fullName": "Paciente Sintético da Silva",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-20",
  "email": "novo.contato@example.com",
  "phone": null
}

### Encontrar o patientRef pelo CPF (POST para o CPF não ir na URL)
POST {{host}}/v1/patients/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cpf": "12345678909" }

### Saúde
GET {{host}}/health/ready
